OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas jumpers wanted for
OL,4,Aannual charity day
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being asked to donate
OL,7,Funwanted children's Christmas jumpers
OL,8,Fto help support local families and
OL,9,Freduce textile waste.
OL,11,FHull City Council said the annual
OL,12,Fcollection was designed to make sure
OL,13,Fmore of the city's children could take
OL,14,Fpart in Save the Children's Christmas
OL,15,FJumper Day on 10 December.
OL,17,FThe deadline for donations is 1
OL,18,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
