OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas jumpers wanted for
OL,4,Aannual charity day
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Charles Quinn, cabinet
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for environment, said:
OL,8,F"Last year, residents donated a
OL,9,Frecord-breaking 145 jumpers, helping
OL,10,Fchildren across the city join in the
OL,11,Ffun of Christmas Jumper Day. This year,
OL,12,Fwe would love to build on that success
OL,13,Fand collect more jumpers than ever
OL,14,Fbefore."
